      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "把战利品带回飞船，在赌场翻倍或输光",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Vending machines dish out boosters and handy items, while the ship’s casino - blackjack, roulette and thimbles - lets you multiply your loot… or lose it all!",
